          "index": 5,
          "old": "But the Israelites went right back to their old habits, doing evil in God's sight. So God powered up Eglon, king of Moab, to go against Israel because they were messing up again. Eglon teamed up with the Ammonites and Amalekites, attacked Israel, and they took over the City of Palms. The Israelites were stuck serving Eglon for fourteen years.",
          "new": "But the Israelites went right back to their old habits, doing evil in God's sight. So God powered up Eglon, king of Moab, to go against Israel because they were messing up again. Eglon teamed up with the Ammonites and Amalekites, attacked Israel, and they took over the City of Palms. The Israelites were stuck serving Eglon for eighteen years.",
